      "label": "origin-repulsion",
      "named_blocker": null,
      "source_found": true,
      "source_snippet": "\\begin{lemma}[Origin repulsion]\\label{origin-repulsion} We have $$ \\|p\\|_0 \\ll \\| p \\|_1 + n \\operatorname{dist}(0, \\partial E_1(p)).$$ In particular, by \\eqref{size-def}, one has $$ \\|p\\| \\ll \\| p \\|_1 + n \\operatorname{dist}(0, \\partial E_1(p)).$$ \\end{lemma}",
